WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.387
The database contains a few small source areas.

00:00:03.387 --> 00:00:07.627
Patient and admission tables support healthcare-style views.

00:00:07.627 --> 00:00:13.577
Employee, department, and sales-order tables support a performance interface.

00:00:13.577 --> 00:00:18.917
Customer transactions support recent activity and retention examples.

00:00:18.917 --> 00:00:27.404
Reusable objects are placed in an analytics schema so the source tables and analytical interfaces are clearly separated.
